              Store <math id="alg4.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{\min},d_{\max}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>min</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>max</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{\min},d_{\max}</annotation></semantics></math>, and <span id="alg4.l8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">thres-int</span> <span id="alg4.l8.4" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg4.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Min and max depths, threshold interval
