<figure id="alg5" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 5</span> </span> Directly Sampled Random Forest (DSRF)</figcaption>
<div id="alg5.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg5.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg5.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
              
              
            Feature dimension <math id="alg5.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math>, number of samples <math id="alg5.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>, number of classes <math id="alg5.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N_{c}</annotation></semantics></math>, task type <math id="alg5.l1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{T}\in\{\textsc{Classification},\textsc{Regression}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒯</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">Classification</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">Regression</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{T}\in\{\textsc{Classification},\textsc{Regression}\}</annotation></semantics></math>, number of estimators <math id="alg5.l1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N_{e}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N_{e}</annotation></semantics></math>, minimum depth <math id="alg5.l1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{\min}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>min</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{\min}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math>, maximum depth <math id="alg5.l1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{\max}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{\max}</annotation></semantics></math>, split threshold interval <span id="alg5.l1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">thres-int</span>, probability of terminal node <math id="alg5.l1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\text{nc}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>nc</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\text{nc}}</annotation></semantics></math>, Gaussian parameters for regression leaves <math id="alg5.l1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\mu,\sigma)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\mu,\sigma)</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg5.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg5.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
              
              
            Generate feature matrix <math id="alg5.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{X}_{2}\in\mathbb{R}^{N\times d}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{X}_{2}\in\mathbb{R}^{N\times d}</annotation></semantics></math> as described in Subsection <a href="#A1.SS2.SSS1" title="A.2.1 Feature and Target Generation ‣ A.2 Data Generation ‣ Appendix A Mitra ‣ Mitra: Mixed Synthetic Priors for Enhancing Tabular Foundation Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2.1</span></a>.

</div>
<div id="alg5.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg5.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
              
              
            <span id="alg5.l3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg5.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg5.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg5.l3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg5.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg5.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
              
              
              <span id="alg5.l4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg5.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=1</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="alg5.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N_{e}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N_{e}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg5.l4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg5.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg5.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
              
              
               <math id="alg5.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\texttt{tree}\leftarrow\textsc{RandDT}()" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">tree</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">RandDT</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\texttt{tree}\leftarrow\textsc{RandDT}()</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg5.l5.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg5.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Sample a random DT from function space <math id="alg5.l5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{F}</annotation></semantics></math> (Alg. <a href="#alg4" title="Algorithm 4 ‣ A.3 Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Mitra ‣ Mitra: Mixed Synthetic Priors for Enhancing Tabular Foundation Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>)
</span>
</div>
