<figure id="A3.T17" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A3.T17.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 17</span>: </span><span id="A3.T17.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Additional results on TabArena. “Single” represents single-model results without HPO. “HPO” represents results after 200-iteration hyperparameter optimization. “HPO + ensemble” represents the ensemble results of hyperparameter optimization. <span id="A3.T17.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Mitra</span> is the strongest single model, outperforming all methods even when they perform hyperparameter tuning. “Train Time” and “Infer Time” represent the median training and inference time in seconds per 1K rows. <span id="A3.T17.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Mitra</span> achieves Pareto efficiency both in training time and inference time.</span></figcaption>
