<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A3.F10.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 10</span>: </span><span id="A3.F10.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Critical difference plot on TabZilla classification benchmark.</span></figcaption>
